{"3677730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Against Twilight", "steam_appid": 3677730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Twilight has fallen. Survive.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Thousands of creatures are emerging from the shadows—and you are the only thing standing between them and the end of the world. Against Twilight is a 2D pixel art survival game where every second counts and every choice can change everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677730/extras/c048559824bbce760d00f770e25a46a0.poster.avif?t=1781805303\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677730/extras/c048559824bbce760d00f770e25a46a0.webm?t=1781805303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677730/extras/c048559824bbce760d00f770e25a46a0.mp4?t=1781805303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVOLVE IN BATTLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find temporary powers, magical weapons and chaotic mutations to dominate the hordes! Each match brings new combinations of abilities - choose wisely and become unbeatable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677730/extras/e992ae2f6ddf2a3658875e7ba6ff03da.poster.avif?t=1781805303\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677730/extras/e992ae2f6ddf2a3658875e7ba6ff03da.webm?t=1781805303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677730/extras/e992ae2f6ddf2a3658875e7ba6ff03da.mp4?t=1781805303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BE WHOEVER YOU WANT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock unique skins for your character and face the twilight in your own style. Each look was designed to reflect the legendary warriors of the Twilight world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677730/extras/8eef13f6c6c79b051f5c8d70d2ce7d9d.poster.avif?t=1781805303\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677730/extras/8eef13f6c6c79b051f5c8d70d2ce7d9d.webm?t=1781805303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677730/extras/8eef13f6c6c79b051f5c8d70d2ce7d9d.mp4?t=1781805303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BECOME UNMATCHED</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gold you collect in each match doesn’t disappear—it makes you permanently stronger. Invest in real upgrades: more damage, more health, special abilities. With every run, you start stronger than before.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compatible with mouse, keyboard, controller, and touchscreen.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Twilight has fallen. Survive.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Thousands of creatures are emerging from the shadows—and you are the only thing standing between them and the end of the world. Against Twilight is a 2D pixel art survival game where every second counts and every choice can change everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677730/extras/c048559824bbce760d00f770e25a46a0.poster.avif?t=1781805303\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677730/extras/c048559824bbce760d00f770e25a46a0.webm?t=1781805303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677730/extras/c048559824bbce760d00f770e25a46a0.mp4?t=1781805303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVOLVE IN BATTLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find temporary powers, magical weapons and chaotic mutations to dominate the hordes! Each match brings new combinations of abilities - choose wisely and become unbeatable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677730/extras/e992ae2f6ddf2a3658875e7ba6ff03da.poster.avif?t=1781805303\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677730/extras/e992ae2f6ddf2a3658875e7ba6ff03da.webm?t=1781805303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677730/extras/e992ae2f6ddf2a3658875e7ba6ff03da.mp4?t=1781805303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BE WHOEVER YOU WANT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock unique skins for your character and face the twilight in your own style. Each look was designed to reflect the legendary warriors of the Twilight world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677730/extras/8eef13f6c6c79b051f5c8d70d2ce7d9d.poster.avif?t=1781805303\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677730/extras/8eef13f6c6c79b051f5c8d70d2ce7d9d.webm?t=1781805303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677730/extras/8eef13f6c6c79b051f5c8d70d2ce7d9d.mp4?t=1781805303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BECOME UNMATCHED</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gold you collect in each match doesn’t disappear—it makes you permanently stronger. Invest in real upgrades: more damage, more health, special abilities. With every run, you start stronger than before.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compatible with mouse, keyboard, controller, and touchscreen.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Survive the twilight or be consumed by it. A casual roguelite where every choice shapes your power — and thousands of creatures stand between you and dawn.", "supported_languages": "English, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677730/a59d92a60bcae9c50ee5781bededd6cfa0420c81/header_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1781805303", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677730/0fa3afb346cb3a945f41d14cce386a9304a77e8d/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1781805303", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677730/0fa3afb346cb3a945f41d14cce386a9304a77e8d/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1781805303", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DX9.0c<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system